    "Apple Fitness+ helps you close your rings anywhere, anytime with a huge catalog of workouts created by the world’s top trainers.\n\nApple Watch or iPhone is required to sign up for Apple Fitness+" : [
      {
        "language" : "de",
        "target" : "Apple Fitness+ hilft dir mit einer großen Auswahl von Trainings, die von den weltbesten Trainer:innen zusammengestellt wurden, jederzeit und überall deine Ringe zu schließen.\n\nFür die Anmeldung bei Apple Fitness+ ist eine Apple Watch oder ein iPhone erforderlich.",
        "filename" : "Localizable.strings"
      },
      {
        "filename" : "Localizable.strings",
        "language" : "en_AU",
        "target" : "Apple Fitness+ helps you close your rings anywhere, anytime with a huge catalogue of workouts created by the world’s top trainers.\n\nApple Watch or iPhone is required to sign up for Apple Fitness+"
      },
      {
        "target" : "تساعدك Apple Fitness+‎ على إكمال حلقاتك في أي مكان وأي وقت من خلال كتالوج كبير من التمارين التي أعدَّها أفضل المدربين على مستوى العالم.\n\nيلزم استخدام Apple Watch أو iPhone للتسجيل في Apple Fitness+‎",
        "filename" : "Localizable.strings",
        "language" : "ar"
      },
      {
        "filename" : "Localizable.strings",
        "language" : "ja",
        "target" : "Apple Fitness+で、世界中のトップトレーナーによって作成された膨大なカタログからワークアウトを選んで、いつでもどこでもリングを完成させることができます。\n\nApple Fitness+に登録するにはApple WatchまたはiPhoneが必要になります。"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Apple Fitness+ helps you close your rings anywhere, anytime with a huge catalog of workouts created by the world’s top trainers.\n\nApple Watch or iPhone is required to sign up for Apple Fitness+",
        "language" : "en",
        "filename" : "Localizable.strings"
      },
      {
        "language" : "es_419",
        "target" : "Apple Fitness+ te ayuda a cerrar tus círculos en cualquier momento y lugar gracias al gran catálogo de entrenamientos creados por los mejores coaches del mundo.\n\nSe necesita un Apple Watch o un iPhone para registrarse en Apple Fitness+.",
        "filename" : "Localizable.strings"
      },
      {
        "filename" : "Localizable.strings",
        "target" : "Apple Fitness+提供大量由全球顶尖教练设计的体能训练，助你随时随地合上圆环。\n\n注册Apple Fitness+需要Apple Watch或iPhone",
        "language" : "zh_CN"
      },
      {
        "language" : "es",
        "target" : "Apple Fitness+ te ayuda a completar tus anillos en cualquier momento y lugar con un amplio catálogo de entrenos creados por los mejores entrenadores del mundo.\n\nNecesitas un Apple Watch o un iPhone para registrarte en Apple Fitness+.",
        "filename" : "Localizable.strings"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Con Apple Fitness+ riuscirai a chiudere gli anelli ovunque e in qualsiasi momento grazie a una vasta offerta di allenamenti creati dal migliore team di trainer al mondo.\n\nPer sottoscrivere un abbonamento ad Apple Fitness+, è richiesto un Apple Watch o un iPhone.",
        "filename" : "Localizable.strings",
        "language" : "it"
      },
      {
        "filename" : "Localizable.strings",
        "language" : "ko",
        "target" : "Apple Fitness+는 세계 최고의 트레이너가 만든 방대한 운동 카탈로그로, 언제 어디서나 링을 완성할 수 있도록 도와줍니다.\n\nApple Fitness+에 가입하려면 Apple Watch 또는 iPhone이 필요합니다."
      },
      {
        "language" : "zh_HK",
        "filename" : "Localizable.strings",
        "target" : "Apple Fitness+提供大量由全球頂尖教練設計的體能訓練，助你隨時隨地完成圓圈。\n\n需要Apple Watch或iPhone才能註冊Apple Fitness+"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Apple Fitness+擁有為數眾多，由世界頂尖教練所設計的體能訓練，讓你不管何時何地，都能完美畫圈。\n\n需要Apple Watch或iPhone才能註冊Apple Fitness+",
        "filename" : "Localizable.strings",
        "language" : "zh_TW"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Apple Fitness+ te ayuda a cerrar tus círculos en cualquier momento y lugar gracias al gran catálogo de entrenamientos creados por los mejores coaches del mundo.\n\nSe necesita un Apple Watch o un iPhone para registrarse en Apple Fitness+.",
        "language" : "es_US",
        "filename" : "Localizable.strings"
      },
      {
        "language" : "en_GB",
        "target" : "Apple Fitness+ helps you close your rings anywhere, anytime with a huge catalogue of workouts created by the world’s top trainers.\n\nApple Watch or iPhone is required to sign up for Apple Fitness+",
        "filename" : "Localizable.strings"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Apple Fitness+ vous aide à compléter vos anneaux où que vous soyez et à tout moment, grâce à un immense catalogue d’entraînements conçus par les meilleurs coachs du monde.\n\nUne Apple Watch ou un iPhone sont requis pour vous inscrire à Apple Fitness+.",
